  fhir:text [
     fhir:status [ fhir:v "extensions" ] ;
     fhir:div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet ahip-background-latino-category</b></p><a name=\"ahip-background-latino-category\"> </a><a name=\"hcahip-background-latino-category\"> </a><p>This value set includes codes based on the following rules:</p><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-CDCREC.html\"><code>urn:oid:2.16.840.1.113883.6.238</code></a><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td>2166-7</td><td>Argentinian</td></tr><tr><td>2168-3</td><td>Chilean</td></tr><tr><td>2169-1</td><td>Colombian</td></tr><tr><td>2156-8</td><td>Costa Rican</td></tr><tr><td>2182-4</td><td>Cuban</td></tr><tr><td>2184-0</td><td>Dominican</td></tr><tr><td>2170-9</td><td>Ecuadorian</td></tr><tr><td>2157-6</td><td>Guatemalan</td></tr><tr><td>2158-4</td><td>Honduran</td></tr><tr><td>2148-5</td><td>Mexican</td></tr><tr><td>2151-9</td><td>Chicano/a</td></tr><tr><td>2159-2</td><td>Nicaraguan</td></tr><tr><td>2160-0</td><td>Panamanian</td></tr><tr><td>2172-5</td><td>Peruvian</td></tr><tr><td>2180-8</td><td>Puerto Rican</td></tr><tr><td>2161-8</td><td>Salvadoran</td></tr><tr><td>2137-8</td><td>Spanish</td></tr><tr><td>2174-1</td><td>Venezuelan</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <code>http://ahip.org/demographics/ImplementationGuide/ahip.demo/CodeSystem/ahip-demo-additional-background-codes</code><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td>9999-12</td><td>Brazilian</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-NullFlavor.html\"><code>http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-NullFlavor</code></a><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-NullFlavor.html#v3-NullFlavor-ASKU\">ASKU</a></td><td>I don't know</td><td>Information was sought but not found (e.g., patient was asked but didn't know)</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <code>http://ahip.org/demographics/ImplementationGuide/ahip.demo/CodeSystem/AHIPDemoAdditionalNullFlavor</code><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td>CNTR</td><td>I choose not to respond at this time</td></tr><tr><td>PSIN</td><td>Please specify if not listed above</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"^^rdf:XMLLiteral
